<p style="text-align: start;">
  Hello,
</p>

<p style="text-align: start;">
  Thank you for your interest in GitHub for Startups!
</p>

<% if @rejection_reason.present? %>
  <p style="text-align: start;">
    <% case @rejection_reason %>
    <% when "not_metered" %>
      Your application was rejected as your startup is an existing GitHub Enterprise customer and/or has previously redeemed the startup offer through GitHub for Startups or through Microsoft.
    <% when "no_payment_method" %>
      Your application was rejected as your Enterprise account does not have a valid payment method on file, which is required to enroll in the program. Please add a valid payment method and reapply for the program.
    <% when "ineligible_enterprise_age" %>
      Your application was rejected as your startup is an existing Enterprise customer. We require that startups be new to GitHub Enterprise to qualify for the program.
    <% when "duplicate_payment_method" %>
      Your application was rejected as your startup is an existing GitHub Enterprise customer and/or has previously redeemed the startup offer through GitHub for Startups or through Microsoft.
    <% when "domain_email_mismatch" %>
      Your application was rejected as you applied for the program using a personal email or an email that does not match your company's domain. Please reapply for the program after <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/account-and-profile/how-tos/email-preferences/changing-your-primary-email-address">updating your GitHub account's primary email address</a> to one that matches your company domain.
    <% when "suspected_abuse" %>
      Your application was rejected due to unusual submission activity associated with the same user and/or payment method within a short period of time.
    <% else %>
      <%= @rejection_reason %>
    <% end %>
  </p>
<% end %>

<p style="text-align: start;">
  If you have not heard back from our team within 24 hours, please reapply for the program after correcting your information. If the issue persists, please reach out to us at <a href="mailto:startups@github.com">startups@github.com</a>.
</p>
